	<!-- Language flags. Kodi names a stream's language in English whatever the interface language:
	     a plain code by its ISO 639 name, a regional or script tag (from {pt-BR} in a track title or a
	     subtitle file name) by the IANA registry's, as German (Austria). A language shows its own flag,
	     in language/; a regional one shows its region's, in country/, except a language in its own
	     country, a community flag at home (Catalan in Spain, Welsh in the United Kingdom) and a
	     constructed language. Latin America (es-419) takes Mexico's flag and Traditional Chinese
	     (zh-Hant) Taiwan's. Kodi's Unknown takes the unknown flag; a name not listed draws none. -->
